lina-traditions/","source_title":"Tar Heel traditions | UNC-Chapel Hill","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Appearances are event-dependent and venue admission rules may apply.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"unc-arts-everywhere-day","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Arts Everywhere Day","title":"Make Space for Arts Everywhere Day","subtitle":"UNC-Chapel Hill campus","notes":"Check the annual program and join an activity that fits your interests, from singing and dancing to painting; follow each host’s participation guidance.","short_summary":"A campuswide annual arts celebration held since 2017.","evidence_claim":"UNC states that Tar Heels have celebrated the annual Arts Everywhere Day tradition since 2017, with activities including singing, dancing and painting.","source_url":"https://www.unc.edu/story/carolina-traditions/","source_title":"Tar Heel traditions | UNC-Chapel Hill","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Annual programming, locations and any registration requirements vary.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"unc-holi-moli","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"UNC Holi Moli","title":"Join the Colors at Holi Moli","subtitle":"UNC-Chapel Hill campus","notes":"Attend through the official event organizers, wear clothes suitable for color powder and follow on-site guidance about accessibility, cleanup and participation.","short_summary":"A yearly campus celebration of Holi that brings students and the local community together.","evidence_claim":"UNC says Holi Moli has been a yearly Carolina tradition since 2008 and connects campus with the local community.","source_url":"https://www.unc.edu/story/carolina-traditions/","source_title":"Tar Heel traditions | UNC-Chapel Hill","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Annual event details and participation instructions are set by the organizers.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"unc-university-day","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"University Day","title":"Mark Carolina’s University Day","subtitle":"Memorial Hall, UNC-Chapel Hill","notes":"Watch for the annual Oct. 12 ceremony and attend only with current event information; it commemorates Old East’s cornerstone and honors members of the Carolina community.","short_summary":"Carolina’s annual ceremony marking the founding-era cornerstone of Old East.","evidence_claim":"UNC states that University Day marks the Oct. 12, 1793 laying of Old East’s cornerstone, was first celebrated in 1877 and includes annual recognition of distinguished alumni.","source_url":"https://www.unc.edu/universityday/","source_title":"University Day | UNC-Chapel Hill","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The annual ceremony’s venue, entry policies and schedule should be confirmed on the current event page.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"unc-hark-the-sound","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"“Hark the Sound” Alma Mater","title":"Sing “Hark the Sound”","subtitle":"University programs and athletic events","notes":"Learn the alma mater before an event, then join in when invited; Carolina identifies it as a song sung at University programs and sporting events.","short_summary":"The alma mater that closes many Carolina gatherings.","evidence_claim":"UNC’s family handbook identifies “Hark the Sound” as the alma mater and says it is sung at University programs and sporting events.","source_url":"https://nsfp.unc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/2024_CarolinaFamilyHandbook-2.pdf","source_title":"Carolina Family Handbook | UNC New Student and Family Programs","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Occurs in event contexts; attendance and accessibility conditions depend on the hosting program.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":["Several traditions are event- or eligibility-dependent; confirm current University scheduling and access guidance before going."]}],"warnings":[]}
